<section class="mushroom-benefits">
  {%- comment -%} Rolling water layers, shared component with the product pages {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="wave-field" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="wave wave--back"></span>
    <span class="wave wave--mid"></span>
    <span class="wave wave--front"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="section-inner">

    {%- comment -%} Section 2, Why one system beats three promises {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Three Mushrooms, One Can</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Three Mushrooms. No Mushroom Taste.</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Most functional drinks lead with a long list of promises. We’d rather tell you exactly what’s in the can and let you taste it for yourself.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="system-story">
      <p>Every can of Fungi Fusion carries three functional mushrooms that have been used in traditional practices for centuries: Reishi, Lion’s Mane and Cordyceps. We use fruiting body extracts, 2,000mg of them in every can.</p>
      <p><strong>Then we made it taste like a fruit soda, not a mushroom.</strong> Sparkling, lightly sweetened with organic agave, and caffeine-free, so it fits the 2pm slot, the gym bag, or the party where you’d rather not hold a cocktail.</p>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} Section 3, The three layers (calm → focus → fuel) {%- endcomment -%}
    <h3 class="system-layers-title">One Can. Three Mushrooms.</h3>
    <div class="benefits-grid benefits-grid--3">

      <!-- Reishi: The Foundation -->
      <div class="benefit-card">
        <div class="benefit-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6260AE" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 22V12"/>
            <path d="M12 12C12 12 7 10 6 6c3 0 6 2 6 6z"/>
            <path d="M12 12c0 0 5-2 6-6-3 0-6 2-6 6z"/>
            <path d="M12 12c0 0-3-5-1-9 2 1 4 5 1 9z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Reishi · 400mg</h3>
        <div class="benefit-role">Fruiting body extract</div>
        <p>The deep-red one, with centuries of history in traditional practices. Every can carries 400mg of Reishi fruiting body extract.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Lion’s Mane: The Focus -->
      <div class="benefit-card">
        <div class="benefit-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#52B788" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M9.5 2.5C7 2.5 5 4.5 5 7c0 1.8.9 3.3 2.3 4.2A3 3 0 0 0 6 13.5a3 3 0 0 0 2.1 2.87C8.4 17.9 9.6 19 11 19h2c1.4 0 2.6-1.1 2.9-2.63A3 3 0 0 0 18 13.5a3 3 0 0 0-1.3-2.48A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 14.5 2.5c-.9 0-1.7.28-2.3.75a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-2.7-.75z"/>
            <path d="M12 10v6M9.5 13h5"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Lion’s Mane · 900mg</h3>
        <div class="benefit-role">Fruiting body extract</div>
        <p>The shaggy white one you’d know on sight, and the biggest dose in the can: 900mg of Lion’s Mane fruiting body extract.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Cordyceps: The Fuel -->
      <div class="benefit-card">
        <div class="benefit-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M13 2L4.5 13.5H11L10 22l9.5-11.5H13L13 2z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Cordyceps · 700mg</h3>
        <div class="benefit-role">Fruiting body extract</div>
        <p>The bright-orange one, Cordyceps militaris. 700mg of fruiting body extract per can and, like everything else in here, no caffeine.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
    <p class="system-synergy">No layering story, no big promises. Just three mushrooms in a cold, sparkling can that tastes like Blue Raspberry, Mango Mimosa or Watermelon.</p>

    {%- comment -%} Section 5, What's Inside (the ONE place the mg spec appears) {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="whats-inside">
      <div class="whats-inside-eyebrow">What’s Inside</div>
      <h3 class="whats-inside-title">Nothing to Hide. Everything on the Label.</h3>
      <p>Real mushroom extracts, not fillers, plus ocean-sourced trace minerals. Caffeine-free, so it fits any hour of your day. And every batch is third-party tested, with Certificates of Analysis you can actually read.</p>
      <p class="whats-inside-spec">900mg Lion’s Mane · 700mg Cordyceps · 400mg Reishi. Fruiting body extracts, in every can.</p>
      <a href="/pages/the-science#lab-results" class="whats-inside-link">See the lab results →</a>
    </div>

    <p class="benefits-disclaimer">† These statements have not been evaluated by the FDA. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</p>
  </div>
</section>

